thly or annual basis.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:59:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/woocommerce-subscriptions/\";s:9:\"is_pinned\";b:1;}i:21;a:9:{s:4:\"slug\";s:45:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-composite-products\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:18:\"composite-products\";s:4:\"icon\";s:100:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/Composite_Products_icon-marketplace-160x160-1.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:18:\"Composite Products\";s:4:\"copy\";s:85:\"Create product kit builders and custom product configurators using existing products.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:52:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/composite-products/\";s:9:\"is_pinned\";b:1;}i:22;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:53:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-dynamic-product-categories\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:26:\"dynamic-product-categories\";s:4:\"icon\";s:61:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/icon-2.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:26:\"Dynamic Product Categories\";s:4:\"copy\";s:302:\"Automatically organize your WooCommerce products with intelligent rules-based categorization. Save hours of manual work while ensuring customers find products faster. Products are dynamically assigned to categories based on price, stock, content, and custom attributes - all updated in real-time.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:60:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/dynamic-product-categories/\";}i:23;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:57:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-woocommerce-points-and-rewards\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:30:\"woocommerce-points-and-rewards\";s:4:\"icon\";s:100:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/Points_and_Rewards_icon-marketplace-160x160-2.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"WooCommerce Points and Rewards\";s:4:\"copy\";s:102:\"Reward your customers for purchases and other actions with points which can be redeemed for discounts.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:64:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/woocommerce-points-and-rewards/\";}i:24;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:63:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-smart-bundle-product-for-woocommerce\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:36:\"smart-bundle-product-for-woocommerce\";s:4:\"icon\";s:94:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/Smart-Product-Bundles-For-WooCommerce-2.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:21:\"Smart Product Bundles\";s:4:\"copy\";s:134:\"Increase your WooCommerce store\'s average order value, create product bundles, subscription boxes, special offers, and bulk discounts.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:70:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/smart-bundle-product-for-woocommerce/\";}i:25;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:48:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-open-box-deal-premium\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:21:\"open-box-deal-premium\";s:4:\"icon\";s:73:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/open-box-deal_logo.png\";s:5:\"title\";s:21:\"Open Box Deal Premium\";s:4:\"copy\";s:138:\"Open Box Deal lets you sell returns that can’t be sold as new. Create deal pages with photos, condition details, and discounted pricing.\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:55:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/open-box-deal-premium/\";}i:26;a:8:{s:4:\"slug\";s:35:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body-printful\";s:7:\"context\";s:26:\"product-edit-meta-tab-body\";s:7:\"product\";s:8:\"printful\";s:4:\"icon\";s:77:\"https://woocommerce.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Printful_Logo_icon_1-1.jpg\";s:5:\"title\";s:25:\"Printful: Print on Demand\";s:4:\"copy\";s:127:\"Sell custom embroidery and print items without inventory or upfront costs. Start or grow your ecommerce business with Printful!\";s:11:\"button-text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";s:3:\"url\";s:42:\"https://woocommerce.com/products/printful/\";}}s:7:\"updated\";i:1768547286;}', 'off');
